  "how_to_read": "the undecided count matters more than the win rate: it is the share of the disagreement document structure has no authority over, and no claim should be made about it here. A high ours_share_of_decided means that where structure can rule, it rules for the boundaries we ship \u2014 which is the specific claim four documents made and none had measured.",
